# Plumb the Forbidden: "When you do, copy this spell for each creature sacrificed this way" is a triggered ability that
# goes on the stack above the spell (CR 603.12), and copies of a spell that has left the stack are made from its last-known
# information (CR 707.10, as for storm). Bot1 sacrifices two Ornithopters; with the trigger on the stack Bot2 counters the
# original with Counterspell (an Island and a Mox Sapphire). The trigger still resolves and makes two copies, which each
# draw a card and cost 1 life: Bot1 draws two (the countered original draws nothing) and is at 18. Bot1 holds 4 cards:
# 3 left after the first turn's plays, 1 drawn for the turn, a Swamp played and Plumb cast, then the 2 drawn by the copies.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Jet
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Plumb the Forbidden
Swamp
Swamp
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Mox Sapphire
Counterspell
Island x4
Island x12

